+| S2 | [RQ-0114](RQ-0114-customer-credit-notes.md) S6; [RQ-0095](RQ-0095-golden-posting-open-questions.md) Q4, S3, S19 | 2026-11-09 | primary via prior research | Adjustment note: shows it is an adjustment note, supplier identity and ABN, date of issue, recipient identity or ABN (larger amounts), brief explanation, the difference in GST, enough to identify the original supply (original invoice number and date). Every credit note is issued as an adjustment note titled "Adjustment note" (`CREDIT_NOTE_TITLE`). |
